{"id":"vod_sn_36411","vodId":"36411","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"银河英雄传说","name_cn":"银河英雄传说","date":"1988-01-01","year":"1988","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/2a0a37938c9f68cc2d52b9595584c189.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在遥远未来的浩瀚宇宙中，银河帝国与从帝国中分裂开来的自由行星同盟是存在于其中的两大势力，他们相互为敌，之间不断发生着残酷的战争。联结着帝国和同盟的，是两条著名的回廊——“费杀回廊”和“伊谢尔伦回廊”，而在费沙回廊中，存在这一个特殊的国家——“费沙自治领”，这个看似弱小的国家以它的方式在动荡的局势中独善其身，成为了不可小觑的又一股势力。　　长久以来，在三股势力之间维持着微妙的平衡，而帝国的莱因哈特·冯·罗严克拉姆（堀川亮 配音）与同盟的杨威利（富山敬 配音）的出现预示着平衡的终结，历史的车轮就此开始转动。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:42:58","playable":true,"episodeCount":110,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/aWqbPgQbtN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/yW2tnq4ira1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/kUsDLrg0B31/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ASTXE134AM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/7DDau8Dv5P1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/pnN8rFwu751/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/sWcxwEFqZS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/G0vx1Ep6dc1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/QV9JGppxpv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/mpeHc0PQjE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Tqb28cGxzZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/d7Tyfa4ka21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/54mxKUJUmF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/RTRkNSSgwQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.